  DialogueNodeData:
  - Guid: 6d139e9a-dcc1-45f7-9d19-e9ed9c266c02
    DialogueText: Hey, how's it going tonight?
    Position: {x: 187, y: 200}
  - Guid: 650dc299-cb60-4f79-8a06-72233177f086
    DialogueText: Yeah, I bet it can get pretty boring out here.
    Position: {x: 504, y: 209}
  - Guid: 301c581f-4662-4457-9959-b5f6686b82b2
    DialogueText: It's just a simple game of chance. So what do you say?
    Position: {x: 3346, y: 8}
  - Guid: 7ce00f99-aefb-473e-9e19-97f311d6521d
    DialogueText: So, is that a yes or...
    Position: {x: 3250, y: 361}
  - Guid: 3d40753c-64da-4357-8c83-93f5344c57da
    DialogueText: It seems super boring working here. That's what I'd be thinking
      at least.
    Position: {x: 427, y: 378}
  - Guid: acdf42cf-919c-4b84-85af-8790e0dcd2a1
    DialogueText: Sweet! All you need to do is follow the Queen of Hearts while I'm
      shuffling them? Ready? Ok! Where is the Queen? Tell you what, I like you so
      I'll even flip over the last card to help you out.
    Position: {x: 4190, y: -209}
  - Guid: f6e674c0-b142-49a8-9331-d0a458f7c114
    DialogueText: Ooh, the Jack of Clubs! That's too bad! Well, a deal's a deal!
      Here's my money, and I'll just be taking those.
    Position: {x: 5598, y: -208}
  - Guid: fe7db2b4-99ea-41c1-8adb-ffc809ab7d43
    DialogueText: Time's up! That means you lose! Well, a deal's a deal! Here's my
      money, and I'll just be taking those.
    Position: {x: 5601, y: -4}
  - Guid: 95aa7804-063e-4e55-9977-ae27f0ec9366
    DialogueText: Ooh, the Jack of Clubs! That's too bad! Well, a deal's a deal!
      Here's my money, and I'll just be taking those.
    Position: {x: 5602, y: -432}
  - Guid: ec199e76-9de0-4894-bcf2-8848a23a9fb0
    DialogueText: Thanks for playing, sucker.
    Position: {x: 6453, y: -430}
  - Guid: 1281d269-c11f-48a1-8183-91f0875a904d
    DialogueText: Sometimes slow is nice, but I usually prefer a little more excitement.
    Position: {x: 544, y: 51}
  - Guid: c6d5da48-58f5-455b-95d2-29176a75c75d
    DialogueText: Hmm... This is awkward, I don't seem to have enough money on me
      right now.
    Position: {x: 1322, y: 56}
  - Guid: c4855537-f2a1-4f87-9c7a-cad626b9a2c5
    DialogueText: No, I don't think I can afford anything else. I've only got $5
      on me right now.
    Position: {x: 1321, y: 223}
  - Guid: ac21741c-f8d1-4609-88a8-bfb5dfaa062e
    DialogueText: Oh is that the total? Oh no... It looks like I'm short a few dollars.
    Position: {x: 1320, y: 385}
  - Guid: af93f235-b8f3-472c-bb2e-e406e04328c8
    DialogueText: I've got an idea! Let's play a game, and if I win, you let me have
      these for $5!
    Position: {x: 2279, y: 41}
  - Guid: 51d1be4c-03cd-4c57-9b0e-b028c1d6887d
    DialogueText: I've got an idea! How about we play a game of chance. If I win,
      you give me a discount so I can buy these for $5.
    Position: {x: 2249, y: 210}
  - Guid: ed6c6f38-4f65-4e43-8166-16f525b9d881
    DialogueText: I know what you're thinking, how am I gonna pay for this then?
      Well I've got an idea! How about a game? If I win, I get these items for $5.
    Position: {x: 2134, y: 393}
  - Guid: 445d820a-059d-4bf9-8c8f-435d12a08ef0
    DialogueText: I'll give you double the total. You'll have some walking around
      money, which I'm sure you desperately need.
    Position: {x: 3246, y: 179}
  - Guid: e1bf4905-0fd5-4661-b991-e5028e517db6
    DialogueText: 'What? Not even interested a little bit? You know what, keep all
      of this. So lame... '
    Position: {x: 4157, y: 228}
  ExposedProperties: []
  CommentBlockData: []
